<!--
	Album / artist / song information (SPEC 6, 8.3; screens/DialogMusicInfo_Album.md, DialogMusicInfo_Artist.md,
	LinerNotes.md). Kodi also loads this file for songinformation (CGUIDialogSongInfo).
	  Album: the cover lit in its glow with the printed disc half out behind it, clearlogo / title / meta at the right
	         with the tracklist under them; icon buttons Play, Shuffle, Liner notes, Artist. Liner notes slide up.
	  Artist: fanart darkened into the room (or the thumb's light when there is none), cutout at the right, clearlogo
	         (else the name), facts line, bio (5 lines), Play all / Shuffle / Biography, the discography as a cover row.
	  Song: cover, title, artist · album · time; Play and Album.

	Kodi id contract (Estuary Omega DialogMusicInfo.xml, GUIDialogMusicInfo.cpp / GUIDialogSongInfo.cpp):
	  50  the list Kodi fills (album: songs, artist: discography; OK opens the item as Kodi does)
	  6   Refresh, 8 Play, 12 Artist / Album info: Kodi writes its own labels into them, so they stay offscreen and
	      Groove's icon buttons click them (SendClick(8) / SendClick(12), LESSONS Duotone 0.9.2). 10 Choose art: offscreen,
	      clicked by the artist row's 9914 (Kodi enables it per profile). 7 (user rating) not shipped.
	  List 50 is ONE vertical panel for both layouts (Kodi binds the first control with id 50 only): album rows are
	  1824 x 64 items drawn at x 1000, artist covers 244 x 640 items drawn at y 780 (the panel starts at x 0 so the first cover's shadow isn't clipped) (one row; Down = next row).

	Focus map (rest row: the buttons, group 9899 = first visible button)
	  Album:  9901 Play  9902 Shuffle  9904 Liner notes  9905 Artist | Down -> 50, Right from 9905 -> 50, Up -> mini
	          player 9950 (when music plays). 50: Up/Down walk, Left / Back -> buttons. Liner notes: Back -> 9904.
	  Artist: 9911 Play all  9912 Shuffle  9913 Biography (bio longer than 5 lines)  9914 Choose art | Down -> 50,
	          Up -> 9950.
	          50: Left/Right walk, Up / Back -> buttons. Biography page: scroller 9922, Back -> 9913.
	  Shuffle 9902 / 9912 only with script.karmamole.helper; Liner notes 9904 only when there is something to read
	  (Liner_HasNotes_item). The buttons after a hidden one slide left; focus falls through it (MInfo_Buttons).
	  Song:   9901 Play  9905 Album.
	  Back on the buttons closes the dialog (Kodi).
	Includes: Includes_MusicInfo.xml (GENERATED by _src/make_player.py), Groove_MiniPlayer (Includes_Player.xml).
-->
